                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is brilliant and shows superior craftmanship.\nThe art, the concept, the puzzles. What a delighful surprise.\n\nMouse middle button vibrates the hero to pass through slim things.\nMouse right button vibrates objects or foes you point to with the cursor, to fall through or be pushed through slim things.\nAfter a while you get a Ligthning staff to destroy objects (Mouse Left Button).\nKey layout can be modified.\n\nDouble jump after 1st ship travel: \nJump, press forward at the highest point, your ghost jumps again, but as a ghost now RUN to a lower place than your real body was before the dwindling bar disappears or you go back to it.\n\nIt's a mystery to me why it isn't more known instead of so many nonsense games plaguing the store.\n\nCheat Engine: If you crave more life, full heart = 3, 4 bytes, Exact. \nLoses 1 with each wound (2, 1, 0 dies). Freeze 3.\nMust find again if new level or after dying/reloading.",
